   a. Individual users, independent developers, students, educators, and researchers.
   b. Non-profit public service institutions, open-source communities, and micro/small
      enterprises (MSMEs).

2. FORKS AND DERIVATIVE WORKS (MANDATORY PUBLIC REPOSITORY):
   a. Users are PERMITTED to fork, modify, adapt, extend, and redistribute this software.
   b. MANDATORY PUBLIC DISCLOSURE / OPEN FORK:
      Any modification, enhancement, adaptation, or derivative work built upon this software
      MUST be made publicly available as an open repository or public fork (e.g. public GitHub
      repository) accessible to the general public. Creating closed-source or proprietary
      modifications without explicit prior written consent from the Author is STRICTLY PROHIBITED.
   c. LICENSE INHERITANCE:
      Every copy, fork, modified version, or derivative work MUST retain this License Agreement
      in its entirety, maintain original copyright attribution to Alif Nurhidayat (KillerKing93 /
      CraftThingy Digital Innovation), and remain subject to all terms herein.
   d. Forking or rebranding the codebase DOES NOT exempt, waive, or diminish any commercial royalty
      obligations specified in Section 3 below.

3. ENTERPRISE & COMMERCIAL REVENUE ROYALTY TIERS:
   Any commercial business, enterprise, manufacturer, contractor, or high-revenue entity
   utilizing this software (or any fork/derivative thereof) is required to license under
   one of the following transparent tiers:

   a. HARDWARE MASS-PRODUCTION (FLAT PER-UNIT):
      - Rate: IDR 5,000 (approx. USD $0.35) per physical unit produced, flashed, or sold.
      - Settlement: Reported and settled quarterly (every 3 months, ending March, June,
        September, and December), payable within 30 days of quarter close.
      - Best for: Manufacturers producing smart controllers, relay modules, and mass consumer devices.

   b. INDUSTRIAL / SINGLE-SITE PROJECT LICENSE:
      - Rate: IDR 2,000,000 per facility, building, industrial plant, or site installation.
      - Best for: Contractors and system integrators executing specific client installations (1-3 projects/year).

   c. ANNUAL UNLIMITED PROJECT PASS (ANNUAL LICENSE):
      - Rate: IDR 12,000,000 per calendar year (equivalent to IDR 1,000,000/month).
      - Scope: Unlimited client projects and installations during the active 12-month period.
      - Best for: Active contractors and system integrators with frequent ongoing installations.

   d. PERPETUAL ENTERPRISE BUYOUT (LIFETIME BUYOUT):
      - Rate: IDR 65,000,000 (one-time payment).
      - Scope: Permanent, lifetime commercial license for designated product line or enterprise
        operations without recurring per-unit reporting or ongoing royalties forever.
      - Best for: Large enterprises, national manufacturers, and corporate conglomerates.

4. DISCLAIMER OF WARRANTY & LIMITATION OF LIABILITY:
   This software is provided "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED.
   The Author shall not be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential
   damages, hardware malfunctions, or third-party disputes arising out of the use of this software.


